{65}{[He sighs] It's my fault. I should have stayed with them. But I specifically told Peri to take the Lifte Fork. I'll wager anything that fool of a Took turned at the left fork. You see, after a wildly successful week in Dernholm,  our next destination was here in Brandybuck. Well, Leeka was getting low on supplies and so I came on ahead while they went to Blackroot to pick up a few things.}{[He sighs] It's my fault. I should have stayed with them. But I specifically told Peri to take the Lifte Fork. I'll wager anything that fool of a Took turned at the left fork. You see, after a wildly successful week in Dernholm,  our next destination was here in Brandybuck. Well, Leeka was getting low on supplies and so I came on ahead while they went to Blackroot to pick up a few things.}{}{}{}{}
