{75}{Well, I don't know if you're aware of this, but the left fork of the road between Dernholm and the Stockton Ford takes you through some hills that's just crawling with highwaymen and brigands. The worst of the bunch is the Wolfe Gang. Those scoundrels are led by a half-orc fellow named Iman B. Wolfe. Villianous scum they are. Absolutely villianous. Which is why I'm fearing the worst.}{Well, I don't know if you're aware of this, but the left fork of the road between Dernholm and the Stockton Ford takes you through some hills that's just crawling with highwaymen and brigands. The worst of the bunch is the Wolfe Gang. Those scoundrels are led by a half-orc fellow named Iman B. Wolfe. Villianous scum they are. Absolutely villianous. Which is why I'm fearing the worst.}{}{}{}{}
